190	- [ ] **Step 3: Verify the foundation**
191	
192	```bash
193	grep -c "backdrop-filter" css/components.css   # expect 0
194	grep -c "unsplash" css/components.css          # expect 0
195	grep -c "!important" css/components.css        # expect 0
196	ls css/                                        # expect only components.css
197	```
198	
199	Reload `http://localhost:8000`. Expected: warm off-white background with a faint teal wash at the top; serif page headings; **no header or card styling yet** — the page is unstyled below the fold. That is correct.
